The Long Way Home 绕远路回家 · Silkscreen Travel Poster demo
Polargate · PolarMotion

Picture: drawn in code (Canvas 2D, engine/silk.js). Landmarks (Temple of Heaven, Hagia Sophia, Eiffel Tower, the Obelisco and
La Boca's houses) are stylised silhouettes drawn as paths from their general shape, not traced from photographs. No logos, no brands,
no maps. The traveller and the trip are fiction; the distances and years on the stubs are facts, with sources in FACTS.md.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licences in fonts/, files fetched by tools/fetch_fonts.sh):
  Big Shoulders Display — Patric King / Google Fonts
  Outfit — Rodrigo Fuenzalida / Google Fonts
  Noto Sans SC — Adobe / Google

Voice: synthetic narration.

Music (original score, music/compose.py) and sound (procedural foley and ambience, mix.py):
  sampled guitar_nylon, accordion, world_perc (darbuka), jazz_bass, glockenspiel, harmonica, snare2 (taps), shaker, cajon, sus_cymbal
  Squeegee, ink, screen, paper, clamp, wind, water, birds, gulls, ferry horn, bicycle bell and crickets: synthesized in code
  (core/audio/sfx.py + mix.py).
